                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Study 4: Exploring Glocalization in the Construction and Implementation of Global Curricula. This study involved 14 in-depth, one-on-one semi-structured interviews with international participants. Data were transcribed verbatim. Through iterative analyses the meaning and implication of the themes were discussed and refined to yield a conceptual analysis of the neo-colonial relationships reproduced and/or perpetuated through educational efforts to develop and implement global oncology curricula. The analysis was performed using NVivo version 11."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
